          },
          {
            "id": 2900060,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Good morning. My name's Lucy Crittenden, and I'm the director of operations for an organization that arranges volunteering in this part of the country. I'm hoping I can persuade one or two of you to become volunteers yourselves. Let me start by briefly explaining what we mean by volunteering. Volunteers are teenagers and adults who choose to spend some time unpaid helping other people in some way.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2900061,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Good morning.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 54.074997,
                  "from": 53.195,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2900064,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My name's Lucy Crittenden, and I'm the director of operations for an organization that arranges volunteering in this part of the country.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 63.219997,
                  "from": 54.075,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2900087,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I'm hoping I can persuade one or two of you to become volunteers yourselves.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 68.58,
                  "from": 63.94,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2900102,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Let me start by briefly explaining what we mean by volunteering.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 73.535,
                  "from": 69.455,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2900114,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Volunteers are teenagers and adults who choose to spend some time unpaid helping other people in some way.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 81.455,
                  "from": 74.255005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2900133,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Most volunteers devote two or three hours to this every week, while a few do much more. The people they help may have physical or behavioural difficulties, for example. Volunteers can do all sorts of things, depending on their own abilities and interests. If they're supporting a family that's struggling, for example, they may be able to give them tips on cooking or recommend how to plan their budget or how to shop sensibly on their income. They might even do some painting or wallpapering, perhaps alongside any members of the family who were able to do it, or even do some babysitting so the parents can go out for a while.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2900134,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Most volunteers devote two or three hours to this every week, while a few do much more.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 88.18,
                  "from": 82.18,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2900152,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The people they help may have physical or behavioural difficulties, for example.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 93.14,
                  "from": 88.58,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2900165,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Volunteers can do all sorts of things, depending on their own abilities and interests.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 100.335,
                  "from": 94.259995,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2900180,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "If they're supporting a family that's struggling, for example, they may be able to give them tips on cooking or recommend how to plan their budget or how to shop sensibly on their income.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 112.69,
                  "from": 100.814995,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2900215,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They might even do some painting or wallpapering, perhaps alongside any members of the family who were able to do it, or even do some babysitting so the parents can go out for a while.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 125.73499,
                  "from": 113.41,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2900251,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "The benefit from volunteering isn't only for the people being helped. Volunteers also gain from it. They're using their skills to cope with somebody's mental or physical ill health, and volunteering may be a valuable element of their CV when they're applying for jobs. Employers usually look favourably on someone who's given up time to help others. Significantly, most volunteers feel that what they're doing gives them a purpose in their lives.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2900252,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The benefit from volunteering isn't only for the people being helped.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 131.41501,
                  "from": 126.695,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2900264,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Volunteers also gain from it.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 134.215,
                  "from": 132.055,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2900270,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They're using their skills to cope with somebody's mental or physical ill health, and volunteering may be a valuable element of their CV when they're applying for jobs.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 145.46,
                  "from": 134.455,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2900299,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Employers usually look favourably on someone who's given up time to help others.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 150.98001,
                  "from": 146.1,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2900313,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Significantly, most volunteers feel that what they're doing gives them a purpose in their lives.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 157.71501,
                  "from": 151.7,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2900329,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "And in my opinion, they're lucky in that respect as many people don't have that feeling.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2900330,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And in my opinion, they're lucky in that respect as many people don't have that feeling.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 163.715,
                  "from": 158.195,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2900347,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 15 to 20. Now listen and answer questions 15 to 20.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2900348,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 15 to 20.",
