            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2900572,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Tanya visits an elderly woman once a week. When the woman found out that Tanya is a professional dressmaker, she got interested. Tanya showed her some soft toys she'd made, and the woman decided to try it herself. And now she really enjoys it and spends hours making toys. They're not perhaps up to Tanya's standard yet, but she gains a lot of pleasure from doing it.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2900573,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tanya visits an elderly woman once a week.",
                "meta": {
